{
 "source": "docs/screenplay/CH01_DIALOGUE.md",
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG001",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "RUSK",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.3,
   "duration": 3.3,
   "delivery": "clipped, guarded",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Hands where I can see them. Name."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG002",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 3.5,
   "end": 6.8,
   "duration": 3.3,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Noah Reyes. My property stays with me."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG003",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "RUSK",
   "start": 7.0,
   "end": 11.1,
   "duration": 4.1,
   "delivery": "clipped, guarded",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Your name does. The rest goes in the tray."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG004",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 11.3,
   "end": 15.4,
   "duration": 4.1,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "That photograph is all I have of my sister."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG005",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "RUSK",
   "start": 15.7,
   "end": 18.6,
   "duration": 2.9,
   "delivery": "clipped, guarded",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Then remember what she looks like."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG006",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 18.9,
   "end": 21.0,
   "duration": 2.1,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Ask for a receipt."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG007",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 21.2,
   "end": 23.8,
   "duration": 2.6,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "You running the front desk?"
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG008",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 24.1,
   "end": 26.9,
   "duration": 2.8,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "No. I know what disappears here."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG009",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "RUSK",
   "start": 27.1,
   "end": 29.1,
   "duration": 2.0,
   "delivery": "clipped, guarded",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Cross. Sit down."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG010",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "GUARD",
   "start": 29.4,
   "end": 33.9,
   "duration": 4.5,
   "delivery": "clipped, guarded",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Contract security signed the delivery. Same seal as last week."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG011",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 34.1,
   "end": 37.4,
   "duration": 3.3,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "The triangle. Where did that come from?"
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG012",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "RUSK",
   "start": 37.6,
   "end": 39.6,
   "duration": 2.0,
   "delivery": "clipped, guarded",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Eyes forward."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG013",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 39.9,
   "end": 42.0,
   "duration": 2.1,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "VANTAGE. You know them?"
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG014",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 42.2,
   "end": 46.4,
   "duration": 4.2,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "I know a crate I should never have opened."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG015",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "RUSK",
   "start": 46.6,
   "end": 49.5,
   "duration": 2.9,
   "delivery": "clipped, guarded",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Thirteen, Cross. Fourteen, Reyes. Welcome home."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG016",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 49.8,
   "end": 52.6,
   "duration": 2.8,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Keep your voice below the pipes."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG017",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 52.9,
   "end": 56.6,
   "duration": 3.7,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "You first. How do you know that name?"
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG018",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 56.9,
   "end": 61.8,
   "duration": 4.9,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Because somebody killed a man and left it in my file."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG019",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 62.0,
   "end": 65.3,
   "duration": 3.3,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "A receipt. You said I needed one."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG020",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "RUSK",
   "start": 65.5,
   "end": 72.0,
   "duration": 6.5,
   "delivery": "clipped, guarded",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Property number forty-two. Keep the photograph. Lose the receipt and the rest was never here."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG021",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "GUARD",
   "start": 72.2,
   "end": 75.5,
   "duration": 3.3,
   "delivery": "clipped, guarded",
   "condition": "intake idle after 20s",
   "main": false,
   "text": "Step onto the painted mark. Both feet."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M01_DLG022",
   "mission": 1,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 75.8,
   "end": 79.0,
   "duration": 3.2,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "badge reminder",
   "main": false,
   "text": "The stamp, Reyes. Look at the stamp."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG001",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "SILAS",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.5,
   "duration": 2.5,
   "delivery": "natural, understated",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Fourteen. You borrowed my bench."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG002",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 2.8,
   "end": 4.8,
   "duration": 2.0,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "It looked empty."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG003",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "SILAS",
   "start": 5.0,
   "end": 7.9,
   "duration": 2.9,
   "delivery": "natural, understated",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "That was the invitation to ask."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG004",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 8.2,
   "end": 13.9,
   "duration": 5.7,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "He is on laundry. You break his hands, you wash your own sheets."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG005",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "SILAS",
   "start": 14.2,
   "end": 16.6,
   "duration": 2.4,
   "delivery": "natural, understated",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "You vouching for him, Cross?"
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG006",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 16.9,
   "end": 19.8,
   "duration": 2.9,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "I am saving you a chore."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG007",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 20.1,
   "end": 22.9,
   "duration": 2.8,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Reyes. The ball. West fence. Easy."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG008",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 23.1,
   "end": 25.6,
   "duration": 2.5,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "You want me to play?"
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG009",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 25.9,
   "end": 28.8,
   "duration": 2.9,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "I want him looking somewhere else."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG010",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "GUARD",
   "start": 29.1,
   "end": 32.4,
   "duration": 3.3,
   "delivery": "clipped, guarded",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Away from the fence! All of you!"
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG011",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "SILAS",
   "start": 32.6,
   "end": 35.9,
   "duration": 3.3,
   "delivery": "natural, understated",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "This buys you a morning. Nothing else."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG012",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 36.1,
   "end": 39.0,
   "duration": 2.9,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "You always make friends this quickly?"
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG013",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 39.2,
   "end": 42.1,
   "duration": 2.9,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Only when I need somebody alive."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG014",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 42.4,
   "end": 48.1,
   "duration": 5.7,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "My sister Elena was on that run. They told me the boat burned."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG015",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 48.4,
   "end": 50.9,
   "duration": 2.5,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Did you see her body?"
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG016",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 51.1,
   "end": 56.0,
   "duration": 4.9,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "I saw a bag. They would not let me open it."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG017",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 56.2,
   "end": 61.1,
   "duration": 4.9,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "The man I was accused of killing was investigating VANTAGE transfers."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG018",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 61.4,
   "end": 65.5,
   "duration": 4.1,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "So we have a logo and two dead people."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG019",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 65.8,
   "end": 69.8,
   "duration": 4.0,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "We have people who want us to stop asking."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG020",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 70.0,
   "end": 72.5,
   "duration": 2.5,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Laundry. We keep asking there."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG021",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "SILAS",
   "start": 72.8,
   "end": 74.8,
   "duration": 2.0,
   "delivery": "natural, understated",
   "condition": "distraction idle after 20s",
   "main": false,
   "text": "Finished thinking?"
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG022",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 75.0,
   "end": 78.3,
   "duration": 3.3,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "missed distraction reset",
   "main": false,
   "text": "Easy. We try when he turns again."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG023",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 78.5,
   "end": 81.5,
   "duration": 3.0,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "optional skeptical stance; reconverges before next objective",
   "main": false,
   "text": "I do not trust you yet."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M02_DLG024",
   "mission": 2,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 81.8,
   "end": 85.0,
   "duration": 3.2,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "optional skeptical stance; reconverges before next objective",
   "main": false,
   "text": "Then trust what we can both see."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG001",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "MARA",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 5.7,
   "duration": 5.7,
   "delivery": "natural, understated",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Medical linen on the blue table. Keep it clear of the general wash."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG002",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 6.0,
   "end": 10.1,
   "duration": 4.1,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "You are the doctor. Why are you counting sheets?"
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG003",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "MARA",
   "start": 10.3,
   "end": 15.2,
   "duration": 4.9,
   "delivery": "natural, understated",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Because blood does not stop being evidence when somebody washes it."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG004",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "RUSK",
   "start": 15.4,
   "end": 17.6,
   "duration": 2.2,
   "delivery": "clipped, guarded",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Inspection, Doctor. Not conversation."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG005",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 17.9,
   "end": 22.0,
   "duration": 4.1,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "This press is catching. We need the inspection lamp."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG006",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "RUSK",
   "start": 22.2,
   "end": 25.6,
   "duration": 3.4,
   "delivery": "clipped, guarded",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "You have one cycle. Then it works."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG007",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 25.9,
   "end": 30.0,
   "duration": 4.1,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Lever down. Tell me when your hands are clear."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG008",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 30.2,
   "end": 32.4,
   "duration": 2.2,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Clear. Hold it there."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG009",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 32.6,
   "end": 35.9,
   "duration": 3.3,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "There is a plan behind the screen."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG010",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 36.1,
   "end": 39.9,
   "duration": 3.8,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Service corridor E. It runs behind our landing."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG011",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 40.1,
   "end": 44.6,
   "duration": 4.5,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Two relays. One opens the grille, one feeds the lock."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG012",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 44.9,
   "end": 46.9,
   "duration": 2.0,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Same time?"
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG013",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 47.1,
   "end": 49.2,
   "duration": 2.1,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Same circuit. Different rooms."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG014",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "MARA",
   "start": 49.5,
   "end": 53.2,
   "duration": 3.7,
   "delivery": "natural, understated",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Put the screen back before you restart it."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG015",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "RUSK",
   "start": 53.5,
   "end": 55.6,
   "duration": 2.1,
   "delivery": "clipped, guarded",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Doctor. The clinic called?"
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG016",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "MARA",
   "start": 55.9,
   "end": 60.0,
   "duration": 4.1,
   "delivery": "natural, understated",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "The envelope is sealed, Officer. Read it somewhere private."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG017",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 60.2,
   "end": 62.2,
   "duration": 2.0,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "He looks frightened."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG018",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 62.5,
   "end": 66.2,
   "duration": 3.7,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Remember that. Do not mistake it for kindness."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG019",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 66.5,
   "end": 71.0,
   "duration": 4.5,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "After count, I open my panel. You watch the landing."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG020",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "NOAH",
   "start": 71.2,
   "end": 75.8,
   "duration": 4.6,
   "delivery": "intimate, tense",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "We leave together. No doors shut behind the other man."
  },
  {
   "id": "CH01_M03_DLG021",
   "mission": 3,
   "speaker": "ADRIAN",
   "start": 76.0,
   "end": 78.0,
   "duration": 2.0,
   "delivery": "low, controlled",
   "condition": "main sequence",
   "main": true,
   "text": "Agreed."
